### =========================================================================
### FlowNet Backend API - REST Client Collection
### Set your environment variables below or in a VS Code .env / settings
### =========================================================================
@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000
@token = YOUR_CLERK_SESSION_JWT_HERE
@targetUserId = user_2sample_owner
@postId = SAMPLE_POST_ID_HERE
@commentId = SAMPLE_COMMENT_ID_HERE
@storyId = SAMPLE_STORY_ID_HERE
@groupId = SAMPLE_GROUP_ID_HERE
@notificationId = SAMPLE_NOTIFICATION_ID_HERE

### =========================================================================
### 1. HEALTH CHECKS
### =========================================================================

### Root Health Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### API Health Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/health

### =========================================================================
### 2. CLERK WEBHOOKS
### =========================================================================

### Clerk Webhook Simulation (Requires valid Svix headers)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/webhooks/clerk
Content-Type: application/json
svix-id: msg_test_12345
svix-timestamp: 1614556800
svix-signature: v1,test_signature_here

{
  "type": "user.created",
  "data": {
    "id": "user_clerk_test_999",
    "email_addresses": [
      {
        "id": "email_1",
        "email_address": "test_clerk@flownet.local"
      }
    ],
    "primary_email_address_id": "email_1",
    "first_name": "Test",
    "last_name": "User",
    "username": "test_user_clerk",
    "image_url": "https://example.com/avatar.jpg"
  }
}

### =========================================================================
### 3. USER PROFILE, SETTINGS & SEARCH
### =========================================================================

### Get Current User Profile
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Update Current User Profile (JSON)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "full_name": "Alex Flow",
  "username": "alex_flow",
  "bio": "Building cosmic apps on FlowNet 🌌",
  "location": "Cairo, Egypt"
}

### Search Users (query = "flownet")
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users/search?q=flownet&page=1&limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get Suggested Users (empty query)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users/search?page=1&limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get User Profile by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users/{{targetUserId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get User Posts (posts)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users/{{targetUserId}}/posts?type=posts&limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get User Media Posts (images/media only)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users/{{targetUserId}}/posts?type=media&limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get Current User Network (followers, following, pending, connections)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users/me/network
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get Blocked Users List
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users/me/blocked
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Update Settings (Privacy, Appearance, Notifications)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/users/me/settings
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "privacy": {
    "is_private_account": false,
    "who_can_message": "everyone",
    "show_location": true
  },
  "appearance": {
    "theme": "cosmic",
    "language": "ar"
  },
  "notifications": {
    "likes": true,
    "comments": true,
    "follows": true,
    "messages": true,
    "requests": true
  }
}

### Deactivate Account (Danger Zone)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/users/me/deactivate
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Delete Account Permanently (Danger Zone - Cascade Deletes Everything)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### =========================================================================
### 4. FOLLOW & BLOCK
### =========================================================================

### Follow User
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/users/{{targetUserId}}/follow
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Unfollow User
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/users/{{targetUserId}}/follow
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Block User (Removes relations both ways, suppresses feeds and chats)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/users/{{targetUserId}}/block
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Unblock User
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/users/{{targetUserId}}/block
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### =========================================================================
### 5. CONNECTIONS
### =========================================================================

### Send Connection Request
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/connections/{{targetUserId}}/request
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Accept Incoming Connection Request
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/connections/{{targetUserId}}/accept
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Reject Incoming Connection Request
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/connections/{{targetUserId}}/reject
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Remove Connection or Cancel Request
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/connections/{{targetUserId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### =========================================================================
### 6. POSTS, FEED, LIKES & COMMENTS
### =========================================================================

### Create Post (Text & Images)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/posts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "content": "Excited to launch our new social network FlowNet! 🚀 #launch #community",
  "image_urls": [
    "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1618005182384-a83a8bd57fbe?w=800&auto=format&fit=crop&q=80"
  ]
}

### Get Feed (Global scope - default)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/posts/feed?scope=global&limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get Feed (Following & Connections scope)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/posts/feed?scope=following&limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get Post Details
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/posts/{{postId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Delete Post (Owner only)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/posts/{{postId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Toggle Like on Post
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/posts/{{postId}}/like
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Share Post
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/posts/{{postId}}/share
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get Post Comments
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/posts/{{postId}}/comments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Add Comment to Post
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/posts/{{postId}}/comments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text": "This is a great milestone for FlowNet! Keep it up! 👏"
}

### Delete Comment (Comment author or Post owner)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/posts/{{postId}}/comments/{{commentId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### =========================================================================
### 7. STORIES
### =========================================================================

### Create Story (Text or Media)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/stories
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "content": "Today's daily motivation story! ✨",
  "background_color": "#7c3aed",
  "media_type": "text"
}

### Get Active Stories
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/stories
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### View Story (Registers view once)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/stories/{{storyId}}/view
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Delete Story (Owner only)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/stories/{{storyId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### =========================================================================
### 8. MESSAGES (1:1 CHAT)
### =========================================================================

### Get Recent Messages (for Home Side Panel)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/messages/recent
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get Conversation Messages with User (Marks incoming as seen)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/messages/{{targetUserId}}?limit=30
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Send 1:1 Message
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/messages/{{targetUserId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text": "Hey! How is your project going?"
}

### Mark Conversation Messages as Seen
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/messages/{{targetUserId}}/seen
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### =========================================================================
### 9. NOTIFICATIONS
### =========================================================================

### Get All Notifications
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/notifications?type=all&limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get Like Notifications
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/notifications?type=likes&limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get Comment Notifications
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/notifications?type=comments&limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get Media Notifications (where post has images)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/notifications?type=media&limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get Unread Notifications Count
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/notifications/unread-count
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Mark All Notifications as Read
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/notifications/read
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Mark Single Notification as Read
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/notifications/{{notificationId}}/read
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### =========================================================================
### 10. GROUPS & GROUP CHAT
### =========================================================================

### Get Available Groups (where not a member)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/groups/available
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get Joined Groups
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/groups/joined
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get My Groups (Owner/Admin)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/groups/mine
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create Group (Enabled if ALLOW_GROUP_CREATION=true)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/groups
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Design Pioneers",
  "icon": "sparkles",
  "description": "Community of UI/UX innovators and creative thinkers"
}

### Get Group Details
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/groups/{{groupId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Request to Join Group
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/groups/{{groupId}}/join-request
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Cancel Group Join Request
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/groups/{{groupId}}/join-request
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get Pending Join Requests (Owner/Admin only)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/groups/{{groupId}}/requests
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Accept Join Request (Owner/Admin only)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/groups/{{groupId}}/requests/{{targetUserId}}/accept
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Reject Join Request (Owner/Admin only)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/groups/{{groupId}}/requests/{{targetUserId}}/reject
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Remove Member or Leave Group
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/groups/{{groupId}}/members/{{targetUserId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get Group Messages (Members only)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/groups/{{groupId}}/messages?limit=30
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Send Group Message (Members only)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/groups/{{groupId}}/messages
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text": "Hello everyone in the group!"
}
